WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:08.842
Are you one of those people who
hate these little crawling things?

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:12.012
Or maybe these ones with
stingers creep you out more?

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:15.782
Have you ever wished that all
the insects would just die out?

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:17.484
Picnics would be much more pleasant.

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.285
And so would gardening.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.728
This is WHAT IF,

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.829
and here's what would happen

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.865
if all insects disappeared from the planet.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.935
If you think bugs only
exist to give you the creeps

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:38.571
and to chew on the lettuce
in your garden, you're wrong.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:39.939
Well, not totally wrong.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.809
Some of them are, in fact,
meant to destroy crops,

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:45.712
give you skin irritations in
addition to painful stings,

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:49.816
and even worse - spread
diseases like Zika and malaria.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:55.121
But 90% of them are not only harmless,
but beneficial to us, and to the planet.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:58.358
They say, without insects,
the world would fall apart.

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:04.064
If we put all the insects on
the planet together on a scale,

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:08.168
they would weigh approximately 300
times more than all humans combined.

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:11.671
If you have insectophobia, you
probably want me to stop right here.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:15.909
Just let me add that, the ants alone
would weigh more than all humans.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:18.812
If our planet suddenly had all
this weight off its shoulders,

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:21.581
farmers would be the first to celebrate.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.817
They'd no longer need to
pour chemicals on their crops

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:26.152
to save the harvest from hungry pests.

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:28.154
But that celebration wouldn't last long.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:32.459
Because without insects,
we'd all starve pretty fast.

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:34.927
And no, we don't mean those bold adventurers,

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:38.731
who snack on crickets and grasshoppers
somewhere in Thailand, would starve.

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.800
Humans might be predators in the food chain,

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.803
but insects are the ones
to hold this chain together.

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:48.274
They are food for some
reptiles, small birds and frogs.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:52.172
If all the insects vanished, those
animals would cease to exist, too.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:55.482
The animals feeding on frogs and
reptiles would be the next to die off.

00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:57.517
And then the ones further up the chain.

00:01:57.517 --> 00:02:00.854
Eventually, this disruption would
work its way up to humans.

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:03.022
Think you could survive by going vegan?

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:04.290
Wrong again.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:08.394
80% of all the plant life on the planet
is made up of flowering plants,

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:11.397
meaning they require pollination to reproduce.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.500
Insects are the ones who make this happen,

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:18.438
by physically transferring pollen from
a male anther to a female stigma.

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:21.641
You can argue that birds and bats,
even wind can pollinate, too,

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:26.479
but most of the work is done by bees,
wasps, moths, butterflies and flies.

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:29.249
Without them, it's 'game-over' for most plants.

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:32.852
Depending on what your food preferences are,

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:36.489
50 to 90% of your diet comes
from those flowering plants.

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:40.960
There would be no fruit, no
vegetables, no rice and no wheat.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:44.831
This also means no food for cows,
chickens, most freshwater fish,

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:47.033
and all the animals we, humans, eat.

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.636
It doesn't matter if you're
a vegetarian or a meat-lover -

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:53.740
if the insects disappeared, you'd
have no chance of long-term survival. 

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:58.645
You'd be left to slowly starve on a planet
heaped up with piles of organic waste.

00:02:58.645 --> 00:03:02.015
Because not only do insects feed
small animals and pollinate plants, 

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:04.450
they're also major decomposers of dead stuff -

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.453
from leaves to corpses.

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:09.656
That wouldn't be the world you'd want to leave in.

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:12.358
And to be honest, not all all
the insects are gross-looking,

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:14.961
wouldn't you agree?

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:14.994
wouldn't you agree?
Join us next time on WHAT IF.

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:17.564
Join us next time on WHAT IF.

